  "Name": "pfSense Diag Routes Web Shell Upload",
  "Description": "This module exploits an arbitrary file creation vulnerability in the pfSense HTTP interface (CVE-2021-41282). The vulnerability affects versions <= 2.5.2 and can be exploited by an authenticated user if they have the \"WebCfg - Diagnostics: Routing tables\" privilege. This module uses the vulnerability to create a web shell and execute payloads with root privileges.",
